help.details:
**Access**

Private chat is open. Groups require authorization by a configured superadministrator; being a Telegram group administrator is not enough. Core settings and group authorization stay in private chat; group RSS subscriptions are managed by group administrators or superadministrators. Input and management controls belong to the panel owner. Read-only group weather switches open a separate panel for other members. Reopen configuration forms and approvals when they become unavailable.

